<?php $title='Shipping Policy';$body='<h2>Processing and delivery</h2><p>Orders are normally prepared after payment clears. Processing time and carrier transit estimates are not yet configured. Delivery dates shown at checkout must reflect the selected service and destination.</p><h2>Destinations and charges</h2><p>Intended service area: United States. Shipping destinations, charges, carriers, tracking availability, and any exclusions must be configured by the merchant before launch.</p><h2>Delays and package issues</h2><p>Carrier delays, weather, and address problems may affect delivery. Contact info@iphonedeals.online promptly if tracking shows a lost or damaged package. Keep the packaging and photographs while a claim is assessed.</p>';require __DIR__.'/legal-page.php';
